id: CTB-SRC0027-clean-step
source: SRC-0027
section: §0.1
kind: requirement
scope: EXE
title: Clean working tree after each step
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000030, LXM-REQ-000134, LXM-REQ-000217
text: Each step ends with git status clean in the canonical writer's workspace: the step's changes are committed, and no modified, staged or untracked file remains. A clean tree is reached only by committing the work, never by reverting, stashing or discarding it; the preserved Phase 1 checkout keeps its uncommitted changes (LXM-REQ-000217).
